{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "06dda74d-258a-8d08-b82a-7651cf1e453d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-25T12:38:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. City Hall's closed today, so you've got me on the storm line. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling because my street, it has not been plowed. Not one time since the storm started. I know City Hall is closed, that is why I call this number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this is the right line for it. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dean Avenue. Thirty-one Dean Avenue, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-one Dean Avenue. Okay. And just so I have it right, nobody has plowed Dean at all, not even a single pass down the middle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. I look out the window, is only snow, and now it is starting to get heavy, like wet. Cars cannot go through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's the snow-to-rain storm today, so it's going to be heavy and slushy as it changes over. Let me put that in. Is this a renter's call, or do you own the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. I am the tenant, Lucia Furtado. F-U-R-T-A-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Furtado, got it. Lucia. Do you want a callback number on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-three. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when you think they will clear it? Today? Tonight? I just want to know when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plows are working through the whole city, and the side streets usually come after the main roads. With the storm still going, I'd say plan on sometime this afternoon into tonight, and they may need to come back once it turns to rain. I'm logging Dean Avenue as not plowed so the crew supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That is good. Tonight is okay. I just need to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. And if you have a car parked on the street, it helps the plows if it's moved off when you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:13-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I move it already to the driveway. Oh, and sorry, I am so happy today, I just found a postcard, a very rare one. I collect old postcards, vintage. This one is from Newport, very old, in the box from a yard sale."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a nice find. Well, keep it somewhere dry while the weather's like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, is inside, safe. Okay, so you have the address, thirty-one Dean Avenue, and not plowed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Thirty-one Dean Avenue, no plowing since the storm began, callback number ending in zero-one-six-three. It's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-25T12:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Lucia. Stay warm, and be careful out there."
    }
  ],
